%% Illustrative structure; replace relationships only from supplied sources.
sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Successful request interaction
    accDescr: A researcher submits a request to a coordinator, which invokes a worker and returns its result. Only the successful path is shown.
    participant R as Researcher
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant W as Worker
    R->>C: Submit request
    C->>W: Execute job
    activate W
    W-->>C: Return result
    deactivate W
    C-->>R: Deliver result
